  "design": "First pre-collision clean warning from each E109 baseline pair with one; plus first step of five motion phases from first successful case in each DOF/seed stratum. All original training bodies; preserve train/held placement labels. Replay each selected baseline completely and exactly; never execute audited alternatives.",
